$NVDA Breaking News for Nvidia:

Bank of America just published their latest Note:

Bank of America upgrades Nvidia with a Buy rating, with a $350 price target, citing its dominant 65-70% Al accelerator market share and strong pricing power. The firm expects upcoming earnings to validate Nvidia&#39;

